# Quote Attributions Required

Every blockquote or quoted text in the playbook must include a proper attribution with:
- The person's full name
- Their credential or title (e.g., "co-founder of Apple", "Nobel Laureate in Physics")
- The source work and year when applicable (e.g., "The Lean Startup, 2011")

Format: "Person Name, credential" or "Person Name, Source Work, Year"
